<title>USA: Nissan June US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Nissan June US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Jun 1-30, 1997     Jun 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    28,576	    28,221	     +1.3</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  14,346	    16,940	    -15.3</p>
<p> Import Car		17,727	    14,147	    +25.3</p>
<p> Import Truck	     6,056	     5,815	     +4.1</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jun 30, 1997 Jan 1-Jun 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   152,838	   158,495	     -2.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  89,950	    80,269	    +12.8</p>
<p> Import Car	     110,977	    95,308	    +17.2</p>
<p> Import Truck	    35,995	    29,510	    +22.8</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 153 for year to date vs 154 in year ago.</p>
</text>
